        <h2 class="about-me-title"><em>About me</em></h2>
        <p class="about-text-par">
            I am an enthusiastic and detail-oriented professional with a passion for quality assurance, holding the ISTQB Foundation Level certification.
            With a strong foundation in both manual and black-box testing methodologies, I am actively seeking a junior software tester or internship position
